# PQ-008: A saturated salt suspension absorbs dilution by dissolving its reservoir
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g
add v1 NaCl 50g
measure v1 conductivity
inspect v1
dilute v1 20mL
measure v1 conductivity
inspect v1
dilute v1 20mL
measure v1 conductivity
inspect v1
dilute v1 200mL
measure v1 conductivity
inspect
